{
  "bodyHash": "e4f0e90b4711c607",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/bundle.png\" alt=\"Serilum 整合包。充满爱意打造。将 Serilum 的多个模组整合在一起，以便更轻松地下载！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-bundle.svg\" alt=\"关于整合包\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>生成物整合包（Spawn Bundle）</strong>是一种特殊的模组，它将 Serilum 的多个<strong>生成类</strong>模组整合为一个。虽然将我的模组归类在一起非常困难，但我尝试这样做是为了让大家更方便地安装。它使用了一种名为 JiJ（Jar in Jar，即 Jar 包内嵌 Jar 包）的系统。这意味着包含在内的模组保持完全独立，但允许像整合包一样捆绑安装。所有模组仍然拥有各自的配置文件，并且你会在游戏的模组列表中看到它们全部列出。<br><br>该整合包是模组包开发的额外辅助工具，但并不替代我个人偏好的模块化模组系统。不过，你可以通过整合包的配置文件禁用其中包含的模组。<strong>更改配置后需要重启游戏才能生效。</strong><br><br>由于 JiJ 系统的工作方式，它既兼容正常单独安装模组，也兼容与整合包中包含的模组同时存在的情况。这主要用于强制指定特定版本，但如果以这种方式意外安装了两次模组也不会造成问题。虽然这可能不是个大问题，但最好只安装一次。因此，如果你决定安装此整合包，可以移除任何已安装的属于该整合包内的其他模组。<br><br>我希望这个整合包对喜欢大型内容模组的你们有用。非常感谢多年来大家的支持！<br><br></span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"环境：服务端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的配置选项：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableBoggedSpawn</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableBreezeSpawn</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableCaveSpiderSpawn</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableGiantSpawn</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableHuskSpawn</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableMooshroomSpawn</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableMooshroomTweaks</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableMoreZombieVillagers</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableSkeletonHorseSpawn</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableStraySpawn</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableZombieHorseSpawn</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableZombieVillagersFromSpawner</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span></div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/available-bundles.svg\" alt=\"可用整合包\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">以下 Serilum 模组整合包可供使用：</span></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-client-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-client-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#006994\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-client-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum 客户端整合包</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-customization-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-customization-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#999\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-customization-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum 自定义整合包</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-extra-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-extra-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#804d4f\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-extra-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum 额外内容整合包</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-qol-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#bf8f6f\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum 生活质量整合包</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-rpg-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#006b3f\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum RPG 整合包</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-spawn-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-spawn-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#805a46\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-spawn-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum 生成物整合包</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/mods-included.svg\" alt=\"包含的模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bogged-spawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/bogged-spawn.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bogged-spawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">泥沼尸壳生成 (Bogged Spawn)</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">增加在所有地方自然生成泥沼尸壳的机会，替代骷髅。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/breeze-spawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/breeze-spawn.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/breeze-spawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">旋风人生成 (Breeze Spawn)</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">增加在所有地方自然生成旋风人的机会，替代烈焰人。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cave-spider-spawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/cave-spider-spawn.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cave-spider-spawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">洞穴蜘蛛生成 (Cave Spider Spawn)</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">增加在地下自然生成洞穴蜘蛛的机会，替代普通蜘蛛。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/giant-spawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/giant-spawn.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/giant-spawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">巨人生成 (Giant Spawn)</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">允许巨人以自定义 AI（基于僵尸）和其他调整自然生成。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/husk-spawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/husk-spawn.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/husk-spawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">尸壳生成 (Husk Spawn)</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">增加在所有地方自然生成尸壳的机会，替代僵尸。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mooshroom-spawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/mooshroom-spawn.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mooshroom-spawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">蘑菇牛生成 (Mooshroom Spawn)</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">增加在所有地方自然生成蘑菇牛的机会，替代牛。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mooshroom-tweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/mooshroom-tweaks.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mooshroom-tweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">蘑菇牛微调 (Mooshroom Tweaks)</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">允许红色和棕色蘑菇牛在其生物群系中自然生成。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-zombie-villagers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/more-zombie-villagers.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-zombie-villagers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多僵尸村民 (More Zombie Villagers)</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">允许更改僵尸生成村民变体的默认几率。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/skeleton-horse-spawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/skeleton-horse-spawn.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/skeleton-horse-spawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">骷髅马生成 (Skeleton Horse Spawn)</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">允许骷髅马自然生成，并配有骑乘的骷髅及其他调整。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stray-spawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/stray-spawn.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stray-spawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">流浪者生成 (Stray Spawn)</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">增加在所有地方自然生成流浪者的机会，替代骷髅。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/zombie-horse-spawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/zombie-horse-spawn.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/zombie-horse-spawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">僵尸马生成 (Zombie Horse Spawn)</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">允许僵尸马自然生成，并配有骑乘的僵尸及其他调整。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/zombie-villagers-from-spawner\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/zombie-villagers-from-spawner.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/zombie-villagers-from-spawner\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">刷怪笼生成僵尸村民 (Zombie Villagers From Spawner)</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">恢复僵尸刷怪笼生成村民变体的能力，该功能在 1.11 版本中被移除。</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以自由地在任何整合包中使用此套件，只要下載仍託管在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內即可。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有可用模組的概覽及更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於我無法在這麼多不同的模組頁面上追蹤評論，因此已關閉評論功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請至 <a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 儲存庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
